; crypt32.dll import surface for the Promise Windows zero-dependency link
; surface (T0772). Provides the certificate/PEM-decode and chain-validation
; entry points the SChannel TLS backend uses (T1598,
; compiler/internal/codegen/pal/tls_windows.go). crypt32.dll ships with every
; Windows install. See kernel32.def header. Regenerate with: bin/release winlink
LIBRARY crypt32.dll
EXPORTS
CertAddEncodedCertificateToStore
CertCloseStore
CertCreateCertificateContext
CertFindCertificateInStore
CertFreeCertificateChain
CertFreeCertificateContext
CertGetCertificateChain
CertOpenStore
CertSetCertificateContextProperty
CertVerifyCertificateChainPolicy
CryptStringToBinaryA
